  "limits": [
    "Adds Zombotany Survival: Day using native five-flag Survival, a persistent lawn and four seed repicks. All 207 authored actors use the six original day plant heads; later rounds introduce new combinations. Native best-flag progress, completion and save layouts are preserved. Prior Sea-shroom and plant-only fixes are retained.",
    "All retained native cases run against the current production objects. Synthetic controls are separately labeled. Browser observations and timing measurements are recorded separately; native tests do not certify browser/compositor performance. Historical Torch observations remain historical."
  ]
